  <section>
    <h2>Start with bounded evidence</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open Diagnostics locally and record the status and evidence source.</li>
      <li>Confirm the <code>RelayBridge</code> Windows service is Running.</li>
      <li>Check management, actual SMTP binding, queue worker, Microsoft runtime readiness, certificate, storage, and disk capacity separately.</li>
      <li>Run the non-authenticated Exchange connectivity check for DNS, TCP, or TLS investigation.</li>
      <li>Use Microsoft <strong>Verify connection</strong> for active certificate, token, TLS, and XOAUTH2 validation.</li>
      <li>Generate and review a support bundle only when the collected evidence is needed for a report.</li>
    </ol>
